--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/aerospace-app-menu.adoc
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+= app-menu(1)
+
+== Name
+
+app-menu - activate an application and select a menu item
+
+== Synopsis
+
+`aerospace app-menu --app-bundle-id <app-bundle-id> [--match-leaf <pattern>] [--click-first]`
+
+== Description
+
+Activate an application by bundle identifier, list matching menu leaves, or click the first matched leaf.
+
+When `--click-first` is provided without `--match-leaf`, the command defaults to matching menu items whose labels start with "new". To match a different prefix, supply `--match-leaf <pattern>` alongside `--click-first`.
+
+This is the minimal building block for Hyprspace-style app-window creation workflows.
+
+== Examples
+
+`aerospace app-menu --app-bundle-id com.mitchellh.ghostty --match-leaf "New Window" --click-first`
